      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because this line involves the spelling of an English word and the spelling of Papyrus' English name, the joke would be lost in a literal translation. After struggling with this line for some time, the translator decided to instead focus on the core meaning and purpose of the statement. Thus, Papyrus' line became:",
